lder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":6,"title":"Girl wringing her hands","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":7,"title":"Girl pointing upwards","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":8,"title":"Girl putting her finger to her lips","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl breathing in and out","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":10,"title":"Girl breathing in and out loudly and softly","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":11,"title":"Girl pointing to her chest","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":12,"title":"Girl jumping up and down","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":13,"title":"Girl listening to her own heartbeat","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":14,"title":"Girl feeling her pulse","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":15,"title":"Girl laughing loudly","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":16,"title":"Girl crying loudly","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":17,"title":"Girl clapping happily","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":18,"title":"Girl looking at her own stomach","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":19,"title":"Girl taking a few leaps","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":20,"title":"Girl sniffing something","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":21,"title":"Happy girl","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":22,"title":"Girl eating jalebis","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"},{"page":23,"title":"Hands clapping, lips puckered and feet tapping","illustrator":"Angie & Upesh","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2008"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನಾನು ಇವತ್ತು ಶಾಲೆಗೆ ಹೋಗಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನಮಗೆ ಇಂದು ರಜೆ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನಾನು ಇವತ್ತು ಟಿ.ವಿ. ನೋಡುತ್ತಾ ಕೂರುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹೇಗಿದ್ರೂ, ಕರೆಂಟ್ ಅಂತೂ ಇಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹಾಗಾದರೆ, ನಾನಿವತ್ತು ಏನು ಮಾಡ್ಲಿ?"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಇವತ್ತು ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ದೇಹವನ್ನು ಆಲಿಸಲಿದ್ದೇನೆ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಮೊದಲು ನಾನು ಶಬ್ದ ಮಾಡದೇ ಇರಬೇಕು. ಹಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ ಮಾತ್ರ ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ದೇಹಕ್ಕೆ ಕಿವಿಗೊಡಬಹುದು. ಪೂರ್ತಿ ನಿಶ್ಯಬ್ದ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹೌದು, ಈಗ ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ಶ್ವಾಸವನ್ನು ಆಲಿಸಬಹುದು.","ಒಳಗೆ... ಹೊರಗೆ... ಒಳಗೆ... ಹೊರಗೆ..."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹಾಗೆಯೇ, ನನ್ನ ಉಸಿರಾಟದ ಶಬ್ದ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿಸಬಹುದು...","ಶ್‌ಶ್‌ಶ್‌ಶ್‌ಶ್‌ಶ್‌ಶ್ ! ಹಾಗೂ ಮೆತ್ತಗೆ ಮುಂ... ಮುಂ... ಮುಂ..."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹಾಗೂ ಈಗ ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ಹೃದಯ ಬಡಿತವನ್ನು ಕೇಳಬಹುದು...","ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ..."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ಹೃದಯವನ್ನು ವೇಗವಾಗಿ ಬಡಿಸಬಲ್ಲೇನೆ ಅಥವಾ ಜೋರಾಗಿಸಬಹುದೇ? ಹೌದು, ಜಂಪ್ ಮಾಡಿದರಾಯ್ತು, ಮೇಲೆ ಮತ್ತು ಕೆಳಗೆ ಇಪ್ಪತ್ತು ಬಾರಿ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಈಗ ನೋಡಿ, ನನ್ನ ಎದೆ ಜೋರಾಗಿ ಬಡೀತಿದೆ.","ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ, ಡೂಡೊಂ!"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಮತ್ತು, ನನ್ನ ಬೆರಳನ್ನು ಕೈ ನಾಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿಟ್ಟರೆ ಆಗಲೂ ನನಗೆ ಬಡಿತ ಕೇಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಬೆರಳುಗಳಿಗೆ ಶಬ್ದ ಕೇಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆಯೇ?"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅಷ್ಟೇ ಅಲ್ಲ, ನನ್ನ ನಗುವನ್ನು ನಾನು ಕೇಳಬಲ್ಲೆ.","ಹಹ್ಹಾ... ಹಹ್ಹಾಹ್ಹಾ... ಹಾಹಾಹಾ!"]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಮತ್ತು ಅಳುವುದನ್ನು.","ಬೂಹೂ... ಬೂಹೂ..."]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಮತ್ತು ಕೈ ಚಪ್ಪಾಳೆ!","ಟಪ್... ಟಪಾ... ಟಪ್... ಟಪಾ... ಟಪ್!"]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಎಲ್ಲದಕ್ಕಿಂತಲೂ ಹೆಚ್ಚಾಗಿ ನಾನು ಇದನ್ನು ಆಲಿಸಬಲ್ಲೆ, ಅದು ಹೊಟ್ಟೆಯ ಸಪ್ಪಳ! ಗುಡು, ಗುಡು, ಗುಡು, ಗುಡು, ಗುಡು..."]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅದೇನಂತಿದೆ...","ತಿನ್ನೋಕೆ ಕೊಡು... ತಿನ್ನೋಕೆ ಕೊಡು..."]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p19.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಆಹಾ ನನ್ನ ಮೂಗಿಗೆ ಜಿಲೇಬಿ ಕರಿಯುವ ಸದ್ದು ಕೇಳುತ್ತಿದೆ, ಅಮ್ಮನ ಅಡುಗೆಮನೆಯಿಂದ. ಮೂಗಿಗೆ ಶಬ್ದ ಕೇಳುತ್ತದೆಯೇನು?"]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಇದು ಒಂದು ಗಮ್ಮತ್ತು, ದೇಹದ ಶಬ್ದಕ್ಕೆ ಕಿವಿಕೊಡುವುದು.","ಮತ್ತು ಈಗ ನಾನು ನನ್ನ ದವಡೆ ಜಗಿಯುವುದನ್ನು ಆಲಿಸಬೇಕು."]},{"n":21,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p21.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹಾಗೂ ಕೇಳಬೇಕು ನನ್ನ ಹೊಟ್ಟೆ, ಅಮ್ಮ ಮಾಡಿದ ಬಿಸಿ ಜಿಲೇಬಿಯನ್ನು ಸವಿಯುತ್ತ ಕರಗಿಸುವುದು."]},{"n":22,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/41-nanna-dehakke-kivigodiri/p22.jpg","width":479,"height":689},"text":["ಈ ಶಬ್ದಗಳನ್ನು ಶರೀರ ಭಾಗಗಳ ಜೊತೆ ಸೇರಿಸಿ","ಹಸ್ತ ಶಥ-ಪಥ","ತುಟಿಗಳು ಕೈ ಚಪ್ಪಾಳೆ","ಪಾದ ಶಿಳ್ಳೆ"]}],"wordCount":196}